      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "LORENZO.\nSo are you, sweet,\nEven in the lovely garnish of a boy.\nBut come at once,\nFor the close night doth play the runaway,\nAnd we are stay’d for at Bassanio’s feast.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
